{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0383_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "00e39ec1168fd58439c6c9be8d5f7482b9b9fa6f4e0ec6251a6ab3f31c228bd4", "ja": "わ、私、悪魔を倒す魔法使いのはずなのに、ぷわぷわの\n悪魔を呼び出す魔法を使っちゃったんでしょうか！？", "zh": "我、我明明应该是打倒恶魔的魔法师，却用出了召唤软绵绵恶魔的魔法吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0383_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "02605cac435500c8588f1a8e8378b3ec838e5a41ae4ed37c185473af522fe0bd", "ja": "ううっ……どうしよう～……。魔法少女ミライなら\nなんとかできるかもしれませんけど……。", "zh": "呜呜……怎么办呀～……虽然要是魔法少女未来，\n说不定还能想想办法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
