{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0383_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "b21bb29feecaa0356841aae6be764c8f71b8ed4a3979b01381a8fbdc9dc60077", "ja": "はい！　悪魔たちを追い詰めて、\nマジカルシャボンで、ぶわ～っとやっつけるんです！", "zh": "是的！要把恶魔们逼入绝境，然后用魔法泡泡，哗啦啦地打败它们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0383_1011_kantoku", "source_sha256": "53fe7d80fa93d49bd8cf7b7cfdf9db0839ed66841c95639394ff7934c2f2b9a8", "ja": "ん？　……ああ、春日さん！　今日の撮影よかったよ！\nおかげで撮影のアイディアが止まらなくてね～。", "zh": "嗯？……啊，春日！今天的拍摄很棒哦！\n多亏了你，我拍摄的灵感源源不断呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
